  `ic_launcher_mark` carries a gradient background rect because a launcher icon has to
  supply its own surface. On a screen that already has one, that rect renders as a visible
  lighter box floating behind the mark — which is exactly how it looked on the splash.
  Same geometry, no background.
-->
